# Copy to .env.local (gitignored, auto-loaded by Bun) and adjust for your machine.

# The browser the capture/test tools drive through puppeteer-core. Required:
# puppeteer-core ships no browser of its own. Any Chromium-family browser works
# — Brave, Chrome, Edge — and it renders with hardware acceleration if available.
#
#   Windows (Brave):  C:\Program Files\BraveSoftware\Brave-Browser\Application\brave.exe
#   macOS  (Brave):   /Applications/Brave Browser.app/Contents/MacOS/Brave Browser
#   Linux  (Brave):   /usr/bin/brave-browser
BROWSER_EXECUTABLE=

# Set to 1 only on a host with no usable GPU: falls back to the SwiftShader CPU
# rasteriser, which renders correctly but is far slower per frame.
#SOFTWARE_GL=1
